OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening across the country, with hazy
OL,7,Fsunshine to end the day. Remaining
OL,8,Fgenerally dry overnight but the odd
OL,9,Flight shower cannot be ruled out.
OL,10,FRather warm light light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,13,Fspells, cloud increasing across the
OL,14,Fwest at times turning sunshine hazy
OL,15,Fand allowing for the odd shower
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling very
OL,17,Fwarm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
